{
  "rule": "promotions",
  "about": "The promotions engine (scope-v1 module 7; #83). A rule applies when every condition it names holds for the member at that moment (its facts); a rule with no conditions always applies. Days and times are the club's: its day runs from 06:00 to 06:00 IST, so 02:00 on Wednesday is still Tuesday night, and a window runs from its start up to, not including, its end. First N counts the promotion's grants already given that club day (at the member's table, or anywhere). A new player has no visit before this one; a lapsed one's last visit was at least that many days ago; visits in the month are the visits closed this calendar month. Hours played and the hand (a high hand or a bad beat) come with the event. A reward is what the rule gives: a bonus share of the buy-in rounded down to whole ₹50 chips, then held to its cap; points a fixed number or the extra of a multiplier on the points earned, rounded down; a bonus or points of nothing is not given. Its rupee cost counts against the promotion's budget (₹0 for a cab, a spin, a ticket or a message). Of the promotions that apply to one event, in priority order, each is given while its count budget, rupee budget and per-player limit allow; one that does not stack is given only alone, and once it is given nothing else is. Facts, effects and candidates are written as the database holds them, amounts in paise.",
  "cases": [
    {
      "description": "No conditions: the rule applies to anyone, any time.",
      "operation": "applies",
      "inputs": { "conditions": "{}", "facts": "{\"at\": \"2026-11-17T21:00:00+05:30\"}" },
      "expected": { "applies": "yes" }
    },
    {
      "description": "Tuesdays: 21:00 on Tuesday 17 November is Tuesday.",
      "operation": "applies",
      "inputs": { "conditions": "{\"days\": [2]}", "facts": "{\"at\": \"2026-11-17T21:00:00+05:30\"}" },
      "expected": { "applies": "yes" }
    },
    {
      "description": "Tuesdays: 02:00 on Wednesday morning is still Tuesday night at the club.",
      "operation": "applies",
      "inputs": { "conditions": "{\"days\": [2]}", "facts": "{\"at\": \"2026-11-18T02:00:00+05:30\"}" },
      "expected": { "applies": "yes" }
    },
    {
      "description": "Tuesdays: at 06:00 on Wednesday the club's Wednesday has begun.",
